WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.102
-Guys, we are just one week away
from Halloween.

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:05.071
That's right. Millions of
Americans are buying candy

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.207 size:81% position:41%
for trick-or-treaters,
which they will rebuy

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:10.010
in six days after they
polish it off themselves.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right. Halloween
is on a weekday this year.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:16.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
Parents are like, "You mean,
I get to work a full day

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.886 size:84% position:42%
and walk around for hou
in the cold darkness?

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:21.521 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wow. Awesome."

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love Halloween.
There's so many fun costumes

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:27.060 line:92%
like, sexy nurse, sexy cop

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.329 line:92%
sexy indicted Trump staffer.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.164 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You know, a fun costume.

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:34.200 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:39.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
But if you're still lookin
for a costume, look no further

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
This year,
you can actually dress up

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:46.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
as a sexy sold-out
Popeyes chicken sandwich.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.448 line:92%
Take a look. This is real.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.917 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There you go. Yeah.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:51.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
Most people
called it ridiculous

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:54.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
while the President called
the Statue of Liberty and said

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.590 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"You've been replaced."

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.760 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.761 line:92%
Let's get to some news here.

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:02.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just when it seemed like
things in Washington,

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:06.199
couldn't get any crazier, chec
out what happened earlier today.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:08.601
-We start with a bizarre turn on
Capitol Hill

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:11.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
when as many as two dozen
House Republicans,

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:14.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
upset over the
impeachment inquiry,

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.975 line:92%
stormed a secure hearing room.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:19.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, Republicans stormed
a closed-door meeting

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
to protest
the impeachment inquiry.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
Even crazier, they used
Mike Pence as a battering ram.

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:26.219 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Ooh! Ooh!"

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Mother. Mother."

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:30.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Mother! Mother! Mother!
Ooh, ooh!"

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:34.794
The Republicans actually stormed
the room as a Pentagon employe

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:37.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
was moments away from
testifying about Ukraine.

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause nothing says
completely innocent

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:42.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
like storming the room
of someone about to testify.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.903 size:75% position:38%
"Don't let him talk!
Don't let him talk!

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
Get in there, quick.
Get in there!

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.440 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Don't let him talk."

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.374 size:75% position:38% line:92%
[ Muffled shouting ]

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:51.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
It really turned into an
ugly scene among Republicans

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:53.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
I haven't seen that many
angry white guys

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:57.517 line:92%
since NBC canceled "Frasier.

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:59.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
Things are pretty chaotic
in Washington.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:01.721 align:start size:94% position:6%
I read that a lot of reporters
think this has been

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:04.591
one of the worst weeks of
Trump's entire presidency,

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:08.695
which is really impressive whe
you realize it's only Wednesday.

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:10.830 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yesterday was
really damaging to Trump

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
after a U.S. diplomat,
Bill Taylor, told Congress

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:18.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Trump withheld military
funding from Ukraine

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:20.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
unless they agreed
to investigate

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.407 size:78% position:39% line:92%
his political rivals.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:24.744
I'm not saying Trump is nervous,
but when he saw the testimony,

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:26.079 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
he was like...

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:28.214 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Screaming ]

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:29.949 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:31.885 line:92%
Some 2020 news this week.

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:33.019 line:92%
There have been a lot of reports

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:36.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
about how more Democratic
candidates are thinking abou

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
jumping into
the presidential race.

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:40.693 line:92%
It's not clear who exactly is --

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:44.831 line:92%
[ Woman laughing evilly ]

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.433 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
H--

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.769 line:92%
Hillary Clinton, is that you

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:51.371 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:53.106 line:92%
-That's right, Jimmy. It's me!

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:55.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
And just like Mitt Romney'
secret Twitter,

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.244 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm always lurking.

00:02:58.244 --> 00:02:59.479 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughing evilly ]

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:02.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sorry. Where exactly
are you right now?

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.450 line:92%
-I'm ever present, Jimmy.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
Always around you,
forever at end.

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:11.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but, really,
where are you?

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I'm in
an air duct, Jimmy.

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:14.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Thud ]
Oh! Gosh.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, well,
can we have somebody help

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:18.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
