out of the air duct?

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:20.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
-See you in New Hampshire!
[ Laughs evilly ]

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.534 line:92%
-Oh, my God. I hope you're okay.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hillary Clinton
in an air duct, everyone.

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:25.471 line:92%
